  "html": "<div class=\"uln\">\n  <div class=\"uln-title\">Upande Livestock</div>\n  <div class=\"uln-grid\">\n\n    <a class=\"uln-tile\" data-roles=\"\" href=\"/livestock_app#/dashboard\">\n      <span class=\"uln-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(59,130,246,.13);color:#3b82f6\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"12\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"16\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"uln-tx\"><span class=\"uln-lb\">Dashboard</span><span class=\"uln-sub\">Today across the whole herd</span></span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"uln-tile\" data-roles=\"\" href=\"/livestock_app#/animals\">\n      <span class=\"uln-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(6,182,212,.13);color:#0891b2\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M8 10h.01M16 10h.01\"/><path d=\"M9 15c.8.7 1.9 1 3 1s2.2-.3 3-1\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"uln-tx\"><span class=\"uln-lb\">Animals</span><span class=\"uln-sub\">Find a cow and her whole record</span></span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"uln-tile\" data-roles=\"\" href=\"/livestock_app#/milking\">\n      <span class=\"uln-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(139,92,246,.13);color:#7c53e0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M8 2h8l-1 4H9z\"/><path d=\"M7 6h10l1 12a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H9a3 3 0 0 1-3-3z\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"uln-tx\"><span class=\"uln-lb\">Milking</span><span class=\"uln-sub\">Record a milking, file the quality</span></span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"uln-tile\" data-roles=\"\" href=\"/livestock_app#/feeding\">\n      <span class=\"uln-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(34,197,94,.13);color:#16a34a\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 14c4-1 7-4 8-8 3 4 6 6 10 7-1 4-5 8-9 8s-8-3-9-7z\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"uln-tx\"><span class=\"uln-lb\">Feeding</span><span class=\"uln-sub\">Mix and feed, what runs out, buying</span></span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"uln-tile\" data-roles=\"\" href=\"/livestock_app#/service\">\n      <span class=\"uln-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(219,39,119,.13);color:#db2777\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-4.5-7-9.5A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 12 8a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7 3.5C19 16.5 12 21 12 21z\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"uln-tx\"><span class=\"uln-lb\">Breeding</span><span class=\"uln-sub\">Heat, service, diagnosis, calving</span></span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"uln-tile\" data-roles=\"\" href=\"/livestock_app#/health\">\n      <span class=\"uln-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(245,158,11,.13);color:#d97706\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2-5 3 10 2-6 2 1h5\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"uln-tx\"><span class=\"uln-lb\">Health</span><span class=\"uln-sub\">Check ups, cases and treatments</span></span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"uln-tile\" data-roles=\"Livestock Manager,Livestock Vet\" href=\"/livestock_app#/culling\">\n      <span class=\"uln-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(196,48,43,.13);color:#c4302b\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 6h18\"/><path d=\"M8 6V4h8v2\"/><path d=\"M19 6l-1 14H6L5 6\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"uln-tx\"><span class=\"uln-lb\">Culling</span><span class=\"uln-sub\">Animals leaving the farm</span></span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"uln-tile\" data-roles=\"Livestock Manager\" href=\"/livestock_app#/settings\">\n      <span class=\"uln-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(107,100,89,.13);color:#6b6459\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M19.4 15a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3 1.9l.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8 2.8l-.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-2.9 1.2V21a2 2 0 1 1-4 0v-.1A1.7 1.7 0 0 0 7 19.4a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.9.3l-.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8-2.8l.1-.1A1.7 1.7 0 0 0 3 15a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5-1H1a2 2 0 1 1 0-4h.1A1.7 1.7 0 0 0 3 9a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.3-1.9l-.1-.1a2 2 0 1 1 2.8-2.8l.1.1A1.7 1.7 0 0 0 9 3V3a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v.1A1.7 1.7 0 0 0 15 3\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"uln-tx\"><span class=\"uln-lb\">Settings</span><span class=\"uln-sub\">Herds, timings and thresholds</span></span>\n    </a>\n\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"uln-foot\">The rest of the app is a click inside any of these.</p>\n</div>\n",
